- [S1] STC11 failed: Each variable definition must have a valid range with at least two distinct values. | Variable `v1` has an invalid range `[]`. | Variable `v2` has an invalid range `[]`.
- [S2] STC16 failed: Every outgoing edge of XOR/OR branches must have exactly one guard. | XOR/OR edge `b1 -> n4` has 0 guards; exactly one is required. | XOR/OR edge `b1 -> n5` has 0 guards; exactly one is required. | XOR/OR edge `b1 -> n6` has 0 guards; exactly one is required. | XOR/OR edge `b1 -> n7` has 0 guards; exactly one is required. | XOR/OR edge `b2 -> n9` has 0 guards; exactly one is required. | XOR/OR edge `b2 -> n10` has 0 guards; exactly one is required.